Package: xplus
Title: Positive and Unlabeled Learning from Unbalanced Cases and Sparse Structures
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Angel", "Robles", , "a.l.robles.fernandez@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4674-4270"))
Description: Implements the PLUS algorithm for positive and unlabeled (PU)
    learning from unbalanced cases and sparse structures, as described in
    Zhou et al. (2022) <doi:10.1371/journal.pcbi.1009956>. Iteratively
    relabels unlabeled observations via penalised logistic regression and
    calibrated pseudo-label updates, then refits a final sparse model.
    Provides prediction, coefficient extraction, and assessment utilities.
